#: ../../site/publication.md:1
msgid "Publication and platform status"
msgstr "发布与平台状态"

#: ../../site/publication.md:3
msgid ""
"This page records the deployment state; it is not a substitute for checking "
"a live site."
msgstr "本页记录部署状态，不能替代对线上站点的检查。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:6
msgid "GitHub Pages"
msgstr "GitHub Pages"

#: ../../site/publication.md:8
msgid ""
"The repository has an admin-configured Pages site disabled at the start of "
"iteration 10. Verified on 2026-10-26 against `cloudQuant/fincore_cpp`: "
"`has_pages` is `false` and `GET /repos/.../pages` returns 404, so no Pages "
"site exists yet. The [`docs` workflow](../../.github/workflows/docs.yml) "
"builds both languages with strict Sphinx checks and uploads one Pages "
"artifact:"
msgstr ""
"仓库在迭代 10 启动时没有启用管理配置的 Pages 站点。2026-10-26 对 `cloudQuant/fincore_cpp` "
"的核验结果：`has_pages` 为 `false`，且 `GET /repos/.../pages` 返回 404，因此尚不存在 Pages "
"站点。[`docs` 工作流](../../.github/workflows/docs.yml) 对两种语言执行严格 Sphinx 检查，并上传一个 "
"Pages 产物："

#: ../../site/publication.md:14
msgid "English: `/fincore_cpp/en/latest/`"
msgstr "英文：`/fincore_cpp/en/latest/`"

#: ../../site/publication.md:15
msgid "Chinese: `/fincore_cpp/zh-cn/latest/`"
msgstr "中文：`/fincore_cpp/zh-cn/latest/`"

#: ../../site/publication.md:17
msgid ""
"Deployment is enabled only after the Pages site is configured to use GitHub "
"Actions and the workflow has run on `dev` or `master`. Enabling Pages is a "
"repository-administrator action on shared infrastructure and is deliberately"
" left to the owner; this documentation set does not claim it. The four "
"checks still required are English/Chinese × Pages/RTD home, installation, "
"one deep API page, language switch, version label, static assets and search."
msgstr ""
"只有在 Pages 站点配置为使用 GitHub Actions，且工作流已在 `dev` 或 `master` 上运行后，才会启用部署。启用 "
"Pages 属于对共享基础设施的仓库管理员操作，本套文档有意不代为执行，也不声称已完成。仍需完成四项检查：英文/中文 × Pages/RTD "
"的首页、安装页、一个深层 API 页面、语言切换、版本标识、静态资源和搜索。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:24
msgid "Read the Docs"
msgstr "Read the Docs"

#: ../../site/publication.md:26
msgid ""
"The versioned [`.readthedocs.yaml`](../../.readthedocs.yaml) is ready for "
"two linked RTD projects (`en` and `zh_CN`). The repository does not have an "
"RTD account/project configured in this environment, so RTD build and online "
"checks are **platform-pending**, not PASS."
msgstr ""
"带版本的 [`.readthedocs.yaml`](../../.readthedocs.yaml) 已准备好供两个关联的 RTD 项目（`en` 与"
" `zh_CN`）使用。本环境中的仓库未配置 RTD 账号/项目，因此 RTD 构建和线上检查属于**平台待完成**，而不是 PASS。"

#: ../../site/publication.md:31
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

#: ../../site/publication.md:33
msgid ""
"A local HTML build is \"deployable artifact\"; a platform build without a "
"live page check is \"online check pending\"; neither is a publication PASS. "
"If one language or platform fails, the previously verified site must remain "
"available and the failed combination must be recorded."
msgstr ""
"本地 HTML 构建属于“可部署产物”；平台构建但未检查线上页面属于“线上检查待完成”；二者都不是发布 "
"PASS。如果某个语言或平台失败，先前验证过的站点必须保持可用，并记录失败的组合。"

